{"id": "34348", "title": "小女子不乖", "author": "宝贝", "category": "文学名著", "count": 40, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/34/34348.htm", "intro": "他以为他帅就可以这样污辱人吗？居然敢栽赃她，说她写情书给他，在大庭广众之下召告她追求他的“伟大”事迹，还一副很够意思的模样，说他愿意让她追、让她爱！天啊！让她死了算了，虽说帅哥人人爱，但他这种死缠烂打的方式，教人不害怕也难，不管她躲到哪里，他很快就找到；不管她跑多快，他一样追得到，就是要她快快认清现实，赶快投入他的怀抱，她真的不认识他啊！她到底是招谁惹谁了？", "base": "files/article/html/34/34348", "chapters": [{"title": "楔子", "file": "2182627.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第1页", "file": "2182628.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第2页", "file": "2182629.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第3页", "file": "2182630.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第4页", "file": "2182631.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第5页", "file": "2182632.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第6页", "file": "2182633.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第7页", "file": "2182634.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第8页", "file": "2182635.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第9页", "file": "2182636.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第10页", "file": "2182637.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第11页", "file": "2182638.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第12页", "file": "2182639.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第13页", "file": "2182640.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第14页", "file": "2182641.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第15页", "file": "2182642.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第16页", "file": "2182643.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第17页", "file": "2182644.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第18页", "file": "2182645.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第19页", "file": "2182646.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第20页", "file": "2182647.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第21页", "file": "2182648.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第22页", "file": "2182649.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第23页", "file": "2182650.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第24页", "file": "2182651.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第25页",